      "content": "acetaminophen doesn't really work for this toothache though, i've tried it and it barely does anything. i really need something stronger like the advil. if i just take a standard dose, like like 200mg or 400mg, and i take it right after a big meal, wouldn't that make it way safer? i feel like i can manage it if i'm careful.",
